@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_33 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:就在艾玛四处奔走的时候，<br>时间来到了预告中的0点——<br>庄严的钟声响遍整个监牢。|#0102Adv26_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_2_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_2_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么办，这就到时间了……）|#0102Adv26_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの通知音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_14 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:听到提示音后，<br>艾玛看了眼自己的手机。|#0102Adv26_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『魔女审判即将开始』|#0102Adv26_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『请大家务必带好自己的手机，<br>　迅速到审判庭集合』|#0102Adv26_Narrative004|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『如有不遵守者，将由看守强制带走』<br>|#0102Adv26_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来典狱长发来的通知<br>都是有固定模板的。|#0102Adv26_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（该走了……我已经尽了自己的全力）|#0102Adv26_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛急忙赶去审判庭。<br>在大门前，她看到——|#0102Adv26_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……樱羽艾玛。|#0102Adv26_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香站在那里。|#0102Adv26_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香！？你之前都去哪了！？|#0102Adv26_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没时间站在这里闲聊了。<br>我是为了出庭才来的。|#0102Adv26_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接下来的事，就在审判中揭晓吧。|#0102Adv26_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香不露声色地说完，就进了里面。<br>艾玛也紧跟其后。|#0102Adv26_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ゆっくりと大扉を開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_165 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,60 AppearanceAndTransition:13_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@WaitForNextFrame

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground Loop:false ScenePositionX:25 Duration:20
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:宽阔的大厅中央设有底座，<br>以及供各位囚犯站立的证人席。|#0102Adv26_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛已是第二次踏进这里，但那肃穆依旧的氛围<br>让她的腿都在打颤。|#0102Adv26_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守把守在大门前，<br>典狱长高高在上的画面也一如既往。|#0102Adv26_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所有囚犯少女均已就位。<br>大家都被奈叶香的出现惊讶得屏住呼吸。|#0102Adv26_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:13_1 SubId:Middle

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:黑部奈叶香小姐，你之前去哪里了。<br>我们找你找了很久。|#0102Adv26_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也罢，现在以魔女审判优先，<br>有关黑部奈叶香小姐的处分稍后再议……|#0102Adv26_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女审判的规则<br>大家都已经清楚了吧？|#0102Adv26_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:是的。请开始吧。|#0102Adv26_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、雪莉、汉娜、梅露露、<br>玛格、安安、亚里沙、可可、奈叶香。|#0102Adv26_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:九位少女站在证人席上，<br>她们都想从彼此的眼里读出对方的真心。|#0102Adv26_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，魔女审判现在开庭！|#0102Adv26_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

